---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 生活
description: 菜菜學習以外的日子：旅行、興趣和日常。
permalink: /life/
locked: true
---
<article class="page">
  <h1 class="page-title">生活</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">學習以外的日子。</p>
  <ul class="subject-grid">
    {%- for c in life %}
    {%- set n = (collections.posts | withTag(c.name)).length %}
    <li><a href="/life/{{ c.slug }}/"><span class="sg-name">{{ c.name }}</span><span class="sg-goal">{{ c.desc }}</span><span class="sg-meta">{{ n }} 篇</span></a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- for c in life %}
  {%- set listPosts = collections.posts | withTag(c.name) | reverse %}
  {%- if listPosts.length %}
  <section class="life-section">
    <h2><a href="/life/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }}</a></h2>
    {% include "post-list.njk" %}
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</article>
